OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford incident involves
OL,4,A'foreign actor', says Rubio, as some
OL,5,Aevacuated residents return home
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents from 85 households evacuated
OL,8,Fon Sunday have started returning home.
OL,9,FWith a cordon still in place and roads
OL,10,Fblocked, they want to know how long the
OL,11,Fdisruption will last, writes our
OL,12,Freporter
